The images for Windows (vbackup.exe, units.exe) are linked statically with
the runtime of MinGW-w64; in them is the winpthreads library of MinGW-w64,
under the licenses below.  The rest of that runtime asks for no notice:
the CRT of MinGW-w64 is in the public domain (or ZPL 2.1, nothing of it
to reproduce), libgcc is under the GCC Runtime Library Exception.

